From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:47:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: three images recompressed losslessly

RLogo.png, New_ui/rt_reaper.png, reaper_emblem.png: the pixel data recompressed, every other PNG
chunk kept byte for byte (pixels verified identical) - 71,249 bytes off the image. The model
header art is left alone (each model's overlay replaces it).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
